  {
   "text": "There were ten two-colored Starter Decks available on Magic Arena from mid 2019 to mid 2020. These were constructed from cards in Guilds of Ravnica , Ravnica Allegiance , War of the Spark and Magic 2020 with each designed around one of the Ravnican guilds . Originally the decks were unlocked through the Account Mastery system, but from March 12, 2020 they were unlocked after completing the new Color Challenges.",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
